1
00:43:03,999 --> 00:43:07,085
That couldn't have gone better,
Mr. President!

2
00:43:07,460 --> 00:43:10,130
You were so handsome and dynamic!

3
00:43:10,463 --> 00:43:11,923
Wonderful!

4
00:43:12,257 --> 00:43:14,718
Very handsome! Very handsome!

5
00:43:15,844 --> 00:43:18,555
Go! Leave me be!

6
01:36:04,759 --> 01:36:07,762
We will not sleep

7
01:36:08,388 --> 01:36:11,849
until the street is flooded

8
01:36:11,850 --> 01:36:16,521
with the blood of every Jarhanpurian!

9
01:42:49,622 --> 01:42:52,292
Our forces aren't prepared
to deal with metahuman anomalies.

10
01:42:52,750 --> 01:42:54,376
I've sent the word to retreat.

11
01:42:54,377 --> 01:42:55,628
Retreat?!

12
01:42:55,879 --> 01:42:57,462
No! No! No!

13
01:42:57,463 --> 01:42:59,090
We must get to the bunker!

14
01:42:59,340 --> 01:43:00,174
The bunker!

